    text: 'An activity list a handful of people keep together: anyone who can open it may add a row, edit any field and delete a row, and every field saves when it loses focus rather than through a form. A deletion removes the row for everybody, after a confirmation that says so. Each row shows who last changed it and when and who raised it, stamped by the database, and a position number with the durable id on hover. Rows marked Done or Dropped are hidden until a tick shows them, with their count. Adding and deleting a row are recorded in the audit trail. It is reached under Administration and is gated by its own module key, so who may open it is an administrator’s decision like any other screen.',
